      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Chlothar: Caribert",
      "content": "Caribert is Chlothar's illegitimate son by a Mondstadt woman. Cursed into a hilichurl as a child, he lay in torpor until a forbidden medicine woke him. He fled on seeing his reflection, removed his mask at a cliff, and unleashed Abyssal power; Chlothar called him the 'Loom of Fate'. The later quest Bedtime Story reveals, per the wiki, that Caribert never became the Loom of Fate: he died as a child, used in building it, leaving only a fragment of his consciousness.",
