      "comment": "Chlothar: The medicine and the sanctuary",
      "content": "Chlothar and the sibling made a medicine from Sumeru Roses, Kalpalata Lotus, and mushrooms, blessed at a Statue of the Seven. The first dose failed; the second worked after a visit to a sanctuary where hilichurls prayed to a 'sinner'. Dainsleif later said the Defiled Statue was one of Chlothar's perverse products.",
