      "comment": "Chlothar: The Abyss Order's founding",
      "content": "Chlothar addressed the sibling as 'Prince' or 'Princess' and said Khaenri'ah had hoped they would bring new strength and hope. The sibling was horrified at first but, after travelling with Dainsleif, concluded he had been right and became the Order's sovereign.",
