      "comment": "Chlothar: The field and the skeletons",
      "content": "In Avidya Forest the Traveler and Dainsleif dug up the field and found a man's and a woman's skeleton. The man's was interred later and holds a silk scarf. The Traveler believed it was Chlothar; Dainsleif suggested he found a way to rid himself of the curse.",
